statements.text:
Instead of listening to concerned employees, OpenAI has shut down internal voices to prioritize profits over safety.

@SenWarren and I are calling for answers.
https://t.co/vc50zwsFh6

Powerful AI is being built right now with almost no federal oversight.

@PublicKnowledge, a longtime safety watchdog, just backed my bipartisan FRONTIER Act as the strongest proposal yet to establish clear, durable guardrails.

Congress must act before the next major incident. https://t.co/RheZqWXh3u

This is a big win for Massachusetts families!
 
@MassGovernor just signed an executive order declaring that no data center can be built without local approval, and the tech companies pay for their own energy instead of passing the buck to residents.
 
Now, Congress should pass the Ratepayer Protection Act and the Protecting Families from AI Data Center Energy Costs Act, which passed @EnergyCommerce unanimously and would build on this progress.
